      <title>India Has the Solar. Can It Power the AI Boom?</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-29/india-has-the-solar-can-it-power-the-ai-boom</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">e84b34570039f0d3b63e7440</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 19:00:16 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Nobody will be surprised if within the next five to 10 years India displaces the US as the world’s second-largest solar grid after China. But if its ambition is to become the world’s factory — or host AI workloads for Western tech giants — the power play around energy must stop.</description>
